<question type="stack">
  <name><text>PDE BVP - Q1: u_xx=0, u(0)=a, u(L)=b</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Solve the boundary value problem:</p>
<p>\[\frac{\partial^2 u}{\partial x^2} = 0, \quad u(0) = {@u0@}, \quad u({@L@}) = {@uL@}.\]</p>
<p>\(u(x) = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text></questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<h3>Solution</h3>
<p>Integrate twice: \(u(x) = C_1 x + C_2\).</p>
<p>From \(u(0) = {@u0@}\): \(C_2 = {@u0@}\).</p>
<p>From \(u({@L@}) = {@uL@}\): \({@L@}C_1 + {@u0@} = {@uL@}\), so \(C_1 = {@C1@}\).</p>
<p>Therefore \(u(x) = {@ta1@}\).</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade><penalty>0.1</penalty><hidden>0</hidden><idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2025073100</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables><text>C1: rand(4)+1;
C2: rand(4)+1;
L: 3;
u0: C2;
uL: C1*L + C2;
ta1: C1*x + C2;</text></questionvariables>
  <specificfeedback format="html"><text></text></specificfeedback>
  <questionnote format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>u(x)={@ta1@}</p>]]></text></questionnote>
