<question type="stack">
  <name><text>PDE BVP - Q2: u_xx=0, u(a)=p, u(b)=q</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Solve the boundary value problem:</p>
<p>\[\frac{\partial^2 u}{\partial x^2} = 0, \quad u({@a@}) = {@ua@}, \quad u({@b@}) = {@ub@}.\]</p>
<p>\(u(x) = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text></questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<h3>Solution</h3>
<p>General solution: \(u(x) = C_1 x + C_2\).</p>
<p>BC1: \({@a@}C_1 + C_2 = {@ua@}\).</p>
<p>BC2: \({@b@}C_1 + C_2 = {@ub@}\).</p>
<p>Subtracting: \(({@b-a@})C_1 = {@ub-ua@}\), so \(C_1 = {@C1@}\), \(C_2 = {@C2@}\).</p>
<p>Therefore \(u(x) = {@ta1@}\).</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade><penalty>0.1</penalty><hidden>0</hidden><idnumber></idnumber>
