<question type="stack">
  <name><text>PDE BVP - Q3: IVP u_t=0</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Solve the initial value problem:</p>
<p>\[\frac{\partial u}{\partial t} = 0, \quad u(x,0) = {@ic_label@}.\]</p>
<p>\(u(x,t) = \) [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text></questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<h3>Solution</h3>
<p>Since \(\frac{\partial u}{\partial t}=0\), \(u\) is independent of \(t\), so \(u(x,t)=f(x)\).</p>
<p>From \(u(x,0)={@ic_label@}\): \(f(x)={@ic_label@}\).</p>
<p>Therefore \(u(x,t)={@ta1@}\).</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
