<question type="stack">
  <name><text>PDE BVP - Q4: Classify Dirichlet/Neumann/Mixed</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>State whether the following boundary conditions are <strong>Dirichlet</strong>, <strong>Neumann</strong>, or <strong>Mixed (Robin)</strong>:</p>
<p>(a) \(u(0,t) = 0\): [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p>(b) \(\dfrac{\partial u}{\partial x}(1,t) = 5\): [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p>(c) \(u(0,t) + \dfrac{\partial u}{\partial x}(0,t) = 1\): [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]] [[feedback:prt3]]</p>]]></text></questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<h3>Solution</h3>
<p>(a) \(u(0,t)=0\) specifies the function value &rarr; <strong>Dirichlet</strong>.</p>
<p>(b) \(u_x(1,t)=5\) specifies the derivative &rarr; <strong>Neumann</strong>.</p>
<p>(c) Involves both function and derivative &rarr; <strong>Mixed (Robin)</strong>.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
